<title>USA: Vyrex ends merger talks with Nutrition 21.</title>
<headline>Vyrex ends merger talks with Nutrition 21.</headline>
<dateline>LA JOLLA, Calif. 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Vyrex Corp said Wednesday it has ended talks to acquire Nutrition 21.</p>
<p>&quot;Our investigation of Nutrition 21 during the post- letter-of-intent phase of the acquisition revealed regulatory, intellectual property and operational issues that posed unacceptable risks to Vyrex,&quot; Carl Lewis of Vyrex said in a statement.</p>
<p>&quot;We concluded that the acquisition, based on terms we had agreed to in the letter-of-intent, was not in the best interest of our stockholders,&quot; he added.</p>
</text>
